cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MC-MED-MEDS"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Robin van de Water"
    email: "r.p.vandewater@gmail.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rvandewater/MC_MED_MEDS"
abstract: >
  An ETL to extract the MC-MED (Multimodal Clinical Monitoring in the Emergency Department) dataset into the MEDS format. Built on MEDS-Extract; the package registers a MESSY
  configuration file that maps the raw MC-MED data to the MEDS format.
license: MIT
